        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Neil LaBute, Aaron Eckhart, Matt Malloy, Stacy Edwards\n- Works: In the Company of Men\n- Awards: Independent Spirit Award for Best Female Lead\n\nFacts:\n- Stacy Edwards was born on March 4, 1965, and she is an American actress.\n- Before 1997, Stacy Edwards appeared in a number of B movies.\n- In 1997, the Canadian-American black comedy film In the Company of Men was written and directed by Neil LaBute.\n- In 1997, In the Company of Men starred Aaron Eckhart, Matt Malloy, and Stacy Edwards.\n- In 1997, In the Company of Men became Stacy Edwards's breakthrough role.\n- For her role in the 1997 film In the Company of Men, Stacy Edwards received an Independent Spirit Award for Best Female Lead nomination.",
